abstract: >-
  Hope 'n Mind Scientific Suite is a unified monorepo of scientific tools
  under the HNM umbrella. Each sub-package has its own version, its own
  Zenodo DOI, and is installable independently. Current members include
  BoltZ-Kernel (non-Markovian quantum solver with Boltzmann memory kernel)
  and forthcoming geometric non-Markovianity measures, Lindblad-distance
  diagnostics, and cross-domain memory-kernel adapters for rheology,
  biology, and climate.
